<title>HONG KONG: Dao Heng Bank interim net rises 62.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Dao Heng Bank interim net rises 62.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   157.0	 vs  101.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    25.0	  vs  23.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  281.65 gain vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    1,097.82    vs  674.76</p>
<p>    Company name		 Dao Heng Bank Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  April 8-14</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   April 15</p>
<p>NOTE - Dao Heng Bank is a unit of Guoco Group Ltd.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of leasehold premises by a subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
